    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:return-value:0008:0001",
      "source": "[`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) if the playhead was moved to `date`, otherwise [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "ko": "[`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)는 playhead가 `date`로 이동한 경우이고, 그렇지 않으면 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6fc45c046a3a0595f755fc8ab3231a03b91a5939d2bd2fdb1ace89dc79e1fbd4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "For playback content that is associated with a range of dates, this method moves the playhead to point within that range.",
      "ko": "날짜 범위와 연결된 재생 콘텐츠의 경우 이 메서드는 재생 헤드를 해당 범위 내의 지점으로 이동합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "37328e66da1ad03764161c75b85b62fd2e10b4d94bb3bb138a19ac3e9dadf337",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "This method will fail (return [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)) if `date` is outside the range or if the content is not associated with a range of dates.",
      "ko": "이 메서드는 `date`가 범위를 벗어나 있거나 콘텐츠가 날짜 범위와 연결되지 않은 경우 실패하며 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)를 반환합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "636248aa0601c7bace26b59a0782b887bfa4765eb00ff336226982ea12cc226b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
